    <Node ToolID="90">
      <GuiSettings Plugin="AlteryxGuiToolkit.TextBox.TextBox"><Position x="60" y="40" width="760" height="110" /></GuiSettings>
      <Properties><Configuration><Text>FP&amp;A Budget Variance Pipeline (Alteryx)  |  Karthik Bommisetty
Reads every department's budget vs actual file, accounts for every row, and shows why 99.8% net accuracy hides $1.21M of misses (95.7% gross).
Thresholds live in the SETTINGS tool. Results go to the output folder; the Results window says whether every integrity check passed.</Text><Font name="Segoe UI" size="10" style="0" />
        <TextColor name="Black" /><FillColor r="225" g="231" b="242" />
        <Shape shape="0" /><Justification Justification="0" /></Configuration><Annotation DisplayMode="0"><Name /><AnnotationText></AnnotationText><DefaultAnnotationText /><Left value="False" /></Annotation></Properties>
    </Node>
